Step-by-step solution: (a) Max comparisons = log2(4096) = 12 comparisons. (b) Python Code:
def recursive_binary_search(arr, low, high, target):
    if low > high:
        return -1
    mid = (low + high) // 2
    if arr[mid] == target:
        return mid
    elif arr[mid] > target:
